The mutation demands that the function return the empty list for every
satisfying input. It is false for the satisfiable formal substitution
`N = 1`, `WS = keepWord(iCons(98,.IntSeq),.WordSeq)`, and for the projected
source input `select_words("b", 1) == ["b"]`.
